  "summary": "Nick Xenophon Team senator Skye Kakoschke-Moore announced her resignation from the Australian Senate after discovering she holds dual British citizenship through her mother. Kakoschke-Moore learned from the UK Home Office that she automatically became a British citizen by descent because her mother was born in Singapore in 1957, when it was a British colony. The senator expressed being 'heartbroken' and surprised by this discovery, as she had previously believed she was not British based on advice her father received when she was 12. She will request the high court determine how her Senate vacancy should be filled, with a recount likely to elect NXT candidate Tim Storrer. Kakoschke-Moore stated her intention to continue with the party and hopes to return to the Senate, while Nick Xenophon described the situation as 'uncharted legal territory' and expressed devastation at losing her from the Senate."
}
```

